{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109209","id":2714217122,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6hx6qi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109209","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109209.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109209.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109209","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109209/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109209/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109209/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/591a24a097a85fd0c907855721f27272824ac91a","number":109209,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Theora: Use libyuv","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm thinking about ways of optimizing video playback for lower end devices and for scenes with several videos playing.\r\n\r\nMost of the CPU time used to display a new video frame is spent in the YUV->RGBA conversion. I've been pondering implementing threads to parallelize video decoding and the pixel format conversion, but the latter would still be the bottleneck. Faster pixel format conversions would improve performance by around 20-30% without using threads. Threads could still be added, creating one thread per VideoStreamPlayer for decoding (multiple videos in a scene), and optionally creating a unique thread to do the conversions if there's still anything to be gained.\r\n\r\nUsing libyuv is around 100% faster than the current code for YUV420,. It might be used to improve performance in the MJPEG and OGV movie writers too, but I haven't tested that yet.\r\n\r\nSee also:\r\n\r\n- #6616\r\n- #9420 \r\n\r\nWhile a GLSL shader would probably be a better option, no one has implemented it yet, and I don't have any experience implementing shaders in the Godot source code. Also, nowadays, in devices where the GPU is the bottleneck, doing the conversion in the CPU might give better overall performance.\r\n\r\nI'm creating this PR early to get feedback on whether this could be a good idea..","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo